WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.216
Open Knowledge base and click Create

00:00:04.216 --> 00:00:06.427
Name it

00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:10.002
Upload a file: a CSV opens in a preview

00:00:10.002 --> 00:00:12.442
Check the CSV's columns and types

00:00:12.442 --> 00:00:19.636
On Add URLs, crawl your site and click Fetch Links

00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:22.631
Tick only the pages you want

00:00:22.631 --> 00:00:25.633
Click a URL to preview the text Ringg extracts

00:00:25.633 --> 00:00:28.324
Click Save

00:00:28.324 --> 00:00:35.829
Files show Processing while it trains

00:00:35.829 --> 00:00:39.751
Indexed: the knowledge base is Ready

00:00:39.751 --> 00:00:46.258
Ask the test chat a question

00:00:46.258 --> 00:00:48.350
Each answer lists the files it came from

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:50.873
Click the CSV to open its rows

00:00:50.873 --> 00:00:56.378
Search, add or edit rows without re-uploading

00:00:56.378 --> 00:00:58.882
The list shows it Ready, with its sources
